        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 19.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In the thirtieth year, in the fourth month, on the fifth day of the month, as I was among the exiles by the river Chebar, the heavens were opened, and I saw visions of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the fifth day of the month (it was the fifth year of the exile of King Jehoiachin), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to Ezekiel the priest, the son of Buzi, in the land of the Chaldeans by the river Chebar; and the hand of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was upon him there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As I looked, behold, a stormy wind came out of the north, and a great cloud, with brightness round about it, and fire flashing forth continually, and in the midst of the fire, as it were gleaming bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 4.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And from the midst of it came the likeness of four living creatures. And this was their appearance: they had the form of men, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but each had four faces, and each of them had four wings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their legs were straight, and the soles of their feet were like the sole of a calf's foot; and they sparkled like burnished bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Under their wings on their four sides they had human hands. And the four had their faces and their wings thus: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their wings touched one another; they went every one straight forward, without turning as they went. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 4.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " As for the likeness of their faces, each had the face of a man in front;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "in front",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the four had the face of a lion on the right side, the four had the face of an ox on the left side, and the four had the face of an eagle at the back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "at the back",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Such were their faces. And their wings were spread out above; each creature had two wings, each of which touched the wing of another, while two covered their bodies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And each went straight forward; wherever the spirit would go, they went, without turning as they went. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 4.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In the midst of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Old Latin: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "And the likeness of",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the living creatures there was something that looked like burning coals of fire, like torches moving to and fro among the living creatures; and the fire was bright, and out of the fire went forth lightning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the living creatures darted to and fro, like a flash of lightning.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now as I looked at the living creatures, I saw a wheel upon the earth beside the living creatures, one for each of the four of them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "of their faces",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for the appearance of the wheels and their construction: their appearance was like the gleaming of a chrysolite; and the four had the same likeness, their construction being as it were a wheel within a wheel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they went, they went in any of their four directions",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "on their four sides",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " without turning as they went. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 10.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 4.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The four wheels had rims and they had spokes;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb uncertain",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and their rims were full of eyes round about. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the living creatures went, the wheels went beside them; and when the living creatures rose from the earth, the wheels rose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherever the spirit would go, they went, and the wheels rose along with them; for the spirit of the living creatures was in the wheels. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When those went, these went; and when those stood, these stood; and when those rose from the earth, the wheels rose along with them; for the spirit of the living creatures was in the wheels.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Over the heads of the living creatures there was the likeness of a firmament, shining like crystal,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
